/-!
# TCP03–TCP06 at every register V4 (lane FC39-VAL6)

Register-V4 file (lane FC39-VAL6), generated by `build-logs/scratch/FC39-VAL6/gen_v4.py`
from FC39-VAL5's `StaticRegisterV3RowsCircle.lean` with register V3 → V4 (`βc` chosen right
after `β₂`, `β₂Up` reads the circle prefix `ClosedCirclePrefixV4` without `βc`; see
`StaticRegisterV4.lean`). It imports no register-V3 module.

The obstruction of lane FC39-VAL4 (register V2 chose `γ, γc, βc` before `β₃`, while TCP03–TCP06
request `γ, γc ≤ γ₀(ν)` and `βc ≤ η_c(ν)` with `3ν ≤ β₃`) disappears on register V4, where `β₃` is
fixed before PR11 and the circle slot reads it. With `ν = β₃/3`:

* total threshold functions (the accepted rows' Skolem witnesses, `1` outside a row's range):
  TCP03 (`tcp03σ_VAL6`, `tcp03η₂_VAL6`, `tcp03γ₀_VAL6`, `tcp03η₁_VAL6` at `(θ, ν)`), TCP04
  (`tcp04σ/η₂/γ₀/ηc_VAL6` at `(θ, ν)`), TCP05 (`tcp05σ/η₂/γ₀/ηc/θ_VAL6` at `(e, ν)`,
  `tcp05η₁_VAL6` at `(e, ν, Δ)`), TCP06 (the same at `(Γ, Σ, e, ν)`);
* `circleRowsStrategyV4 D`: the circle slot (`γ, γc ≤ γ₀`, `βc ≤ η_c` of TCP03–TCP06 at
  `ν = β₃/3`), `β₂Up` (`3β₂ ≤ σ`, `β₂ ≤ η₂`), `errorsUp` (`ζ, σc, σs ≤ θ²/1000`, `v_s, ε_r ≤ θ/100`,
  `ε ≤ 1`), `sectionUp` (`μΔ ≤ θ/100`), `splitUp`/`β₁Up` (`b, β₁ ≤ η₁`) and `L_max`'s lower request
  (`σ⁻¹`, `4(10 + 4·10⁶Δ + Δ/3)`), `lc18 = 1/2` (so `ν < 1`, `β 3 < 1`);
* `tcp03_out_of_below_VAL6`, `tcp04_out_of_below_VAL6`, `tcp05_out_of_below_VAL6`,
  `tcp06_out_of_below_VAL6`: at every register of a strategy below it (with `C_ge`), the row
  conclusions on every final family at the register's values (TCP03 and TCP04 at `θ₂`, TCP05 at
  `e₀`, TCP06 at `(Γ₀, Σ₀, e₀)`, as in `ClosedRowOutsV4`).
-/

